claim.claim-text:
means for performing dual connectivity of a master cell group associated with a master node, MN, (1) and a secondary cell group associated with a secondary node, SN, (2);
means for receiving a third Radio Resource Control, RRC, message of an MN Radio Access Technology, RAT, from the master node, the third RRC message containing a first RRC message of an SN RAT from the SN (2), the first RRC message containing an execution condition of a conditional secondary cell group primary cell, PSCell, change from a first cell to a second cell; and
means for, in response to the execution condition being satisfied, transmitting a fourth RRC message of the MN RAT containing a second RRC message of the SN RAT to the master node.

means for receiving from a secondary node, SN, (2) of the dual connectivity a first Radio Resource Control, RRC, message of an SN RAT containing an execution condition of a conditional secondary cell group primary cell, PSCell, change from a first cell to a second cell;
means for transmitting to the radio terminal (3) a third RRC message of an MN RAT containing the first RRC message;
means for receiving from the radio terminal (3) a fourth RRC message of the MN RAT containing a second RRC message of the SN RAT, in a case where the execution condition is satisfied; and
means for sending the second RRC message to the SN (2).

performing dual connectivity of a master cell group associated with a master node, MN, and a secondary cell group associated with a secondary node, SN, (2);
receiving a third Radio Resource Control, RRC, message of an MN Radio Access Technology, RAT, from the master node, the third RRC message containing a first RRC message of an SN RAT from the SN (2), the first RRC message containing an execution condition of a conditional secondary cell group primary cell, PSCell, change from a first cell to a second cell; and
in response to the execution condition being satisfied, transmitting a fourth RRC message of the MN RAT containing a second RRC message of the SN RAT to the master node.

receiving from a secondary node, SN, (2) of the dual connectivity a first Radio Resource Control, RRC, message of an SN RAT containing an execution condition of a conditional secondary cell group primary cell, PSCell, change from a first cell to a second cell;
transmitting to the radio terminal (3) a third RRC message of an MN RAT containing the first RRC message;
receiving from the radio terminal (3) a fourth RRC message of the MN RAT containing a second RRC message of the SN RAT, in a case where the execution condition is satisfied; and
sending the second RRC message to the SN (2).
